, sweets, and animated surprises\nA gentle, scenic train ride through a candy world\n\nTake a break and enjoy a magical ride full of candies, colors, and fun.", "short_description": "Candy\u2011themed vr train ride through a scenic colorful world with animated surprises."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/landraysstudio/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Land Rays Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/landraysstudio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "34947218791593233"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2175620356541436"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2175620356541436"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1783360980, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2175620356541436"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "38187214707593609", "version": "0.10.0"}, "id": "1764897291345485", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "34947218764926569", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename":